            "filename": "bank_change_letter.pdf",
            "text": "Kestrelwick Safety Gear\nNOTICE OF CHANGE OF BANK DETAILS\nEffective immediately, please remit all payments to:\nBank: Unity Pacific Savings\nAccount number: 7317902955\nRouting number: 996580190\nThis change was confirmed by telephone with your accounts payable lead.\nAuthorised signatory: Hester Quinn"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-03-02T08:30",
